00:05:23,390 --> 00:05:30,360
<font face="simHei" size="25" color="#000000"><b>{\an7}<font color="#7cc5b6">m 79 223 s 140 187 255 186 334 196 428 209 532 197 573 184 464 227 339 215 292 204 215 197 141 204 108 210 c</font></b></font>

